{
 "$description": "The Figma kit \"iOS and iPadOS 27\" (Apple Design Resources, Figma Community) mapped to the Plenix iOS pages: every public component of the kit, grouped by its kit page; each kit page names the Plenix iOS page (HIG page) it draws, and a component that draws another page names its own. Node ids are the kit's, so each opens in the Plenix copy of the file. Read from the kit file (its .fig canvas) in batch 334; build-native-guidance.js checks every iOS page exists.",
